  defaultTutorialTasks:
  - taskName: Open Calendar
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - Hey Mate your Grandad left this shed behind when he fled the Country
    - 'This is your main base of operation where everything important happens  '
    - I have marked your calendar up with all the important upcoming events click
      on the calendar to have a look
    CompletedtaskDialogs:
    - 'There are buttons at the bottom that allow you to navigate the months  '
    taskType: 1
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 1
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Close Calendar
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Do a bit of exploring then press Hide calendar to close the calendar '
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 2
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Open Bulletin Task
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'The bulletin board is where you can manage everthing '
    - 'Click on the Bulletin Board to have a look '
    CompletedtaskDialogs:
    - 'Here you can manage everything  '
    - 'Start race, find jobs, train your team members ,pay bills and sleep  '
    taskType: 0
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Complete A Practice Race
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Lets get right into the racing  '
    - 'Click on pratice race to get familar with your current team ability '
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 4
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: 'Click on the tv '
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Good Job on completing the race '
    - 'You should click on the tv to see whats on '
    CompletedtaskDialogs:
    - Here you can save and manage other settings
    taskType: 14
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Exit Tv
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - When your ready exit the tv
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 15
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Open Team Manager Task
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Lets get familiar with the team '
    - 'Click on team manager '
    CompletedtaskDialogs:
    - 'Here you can see all your teams stats '
    - 'All the attributes are combined together to teams quality '
    - 'Keep an eye on the stars this will let your know how they compare vs everyone
      else in the league '
    - You may also swap around team members if you desire by clicking on active team
      members and one that is benched
    taskType: 3
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Open Hireable Sailor Menu
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - Open Hireable Sailor Menu
    CompletedtaskDialogs:
    - You may also hire racers if you have a bit extra coins and are in need of some
      help for a race
    - Hired racers can not be trained and are limited to a certain amount of racers
      so keep that in mind
    taskType: 18
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Close Team Manager
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - When ready leave the team manager
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 19
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Open Training Menu
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - In order to keep up with the opponents we must constantly train our team
    - 'click on training '
    CompletedtaskDialogs:
    - Here you can see a button for each attribute it will cost you 50 euros per
      training game
    - 'be sure to spread around the training and to have a nice balanced squad '
    taskType: 12
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Train a member of the squad
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Click on a attribute you want to train and select a member then press train  '
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 5
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Open Bill Menu
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - Oh I forgot to mention all the bills are now in your name
    - Lets check out the bill menu on the bulletin board
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 6
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Close Bill Menu
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Ohh no looks like we are out of money '
    - When your ready Exit the bill menu
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 17
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Work a Job
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - You will require money to pay for the teams expensives and bills
    - 'Click on job to start a shift '
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 7
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: 'Pay a bill '
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - Alright now that you have some money lets pay a bill
    - Click back on the bulletin board and go into the bill manager and pay a bill
    CompletedtaskDialogs:
    - 'Good job paying your first bill '
    - Keep in mind that you don't have to pay the bill on time but it will cost you
      interest and eventually it will get auto debited
    - 'meaning you may go into debt and trust me you don''t want to do that '
    taskType: 8
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Close Bill Manager
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Close the bill manager when your ready '
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 20
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Sleep
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - 'Its been a long day you should get some sleep '
    - 'You can click on sleep to get some rest '
    - keep in mind sleeping isn't free and if you can't afford a nice place to rest
      you won't be as well rested the next day
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 9
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Join Tutorial League
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - There will always be a race on sunday
    - This is the big race and winning it can lead to some big prizes
    - Your about to get an invite accept it and LET'S RACE!!!
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 10
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Race in the tournment
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - Alright now that you've joined the league you can click on league to see the
      table
    - 'This is a 1 race league so winner takes it all '
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 11
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
  - taskName: Completed all Tasks
    taskDescription: 
    taskDialogs:
    - Good Job Completing all tasks
    - 'You are now on your own be sure to take care of your teammates and good luck '
    CompletedtaskDialogs: []
    taskType: 16
    hasTutorialDialogsBeenShown: 0
    isTaskActive: 0
    completed: 0
